    "repeat": {
      "mode": "once-per-run"
    },
    "priority": 400,
    "weight": 1
  },
  "presentation": {
    "location": "契約保管庫",
    "assets": [
      {
        "id": "amara.crisis.asset.background.001",
        "kind": "background",
        "path": "/assets/story/bg-contract-archive-v2.png",
        "alt": "契約保管庫の背景"
      },
      {
        "id": "amara.crisis.asset.still.001",
        "kind": "still",
        "path": "/assets/story/events/amara-crisis.png",
        "alt": "公開法廷に立つアマラとミミの一枚絵"
      }
    ]
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.crisis.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "amara.crisis.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "アマラさんに避けられて、六日目。廊下で手を振ったら、業務用の会釈だけが返ってきた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.crisis.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "amara.crisis.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "開廷すら、されない。それが一番おかしい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.crisis.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "amara.crisis.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "七日目。黒い角封筒が届いた。差出人はアルデバラン社・物語資産管理部。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.crisis.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "amara.crisis.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「契約確認書、資産『アマラ』の本社回収について。期限、次の公式戦まで」資産。回収。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.crisis.node.line.002c",
      "lineId": "amara.crisis.line.002c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "人を、荷物みたいに。決定欄は空白のまま、私を見上げていた。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.crisis.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "amara.crisis.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "契約保管庫の扉の中から、声がした。アマラさんの声で、アマラさんじゃないみたいな声。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.crisis.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "amara.crisis.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.14shtqw",
      "speakerName": "アマラ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "——以上の理由により、原告アマラは、所有者ミミを……。……違う。この言い方も、違う。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.crisis.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "amara.crisis.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "扉の隙間からのぞくと、一人の法廷だった。原告席にアマラの契約書。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.crisis.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "amara.crisis.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "被告席に——私の名札。床には丸めた下書きが、雪みたいに積もってた。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.crisis.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "amara.crisis.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……入って、いいですか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "amara.crisis.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "amara.crisis.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "amara.crisis.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "effect",
        "effectId": "shake"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.crisis.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "amara.crisis.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.14shtqw",
      "speakerName": "アマラ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "!　……傍聴は、認めていません。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.crisis.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "amara.crisis.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "じゃあ被告として入ります。席、あるみたいですし。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.crisis.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "amara.crisis.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.14shtqw",
      "speakerName": "アマラ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……アルデバラン社が、私の回収期限を切りました。私は、会社を訴えます。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.crisis.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "amara.crisis.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.14shtqw",
      "speakerName": "アマラ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "だが、あなたが所有者である限り、私の訴えはあなたへの訴えになる。利益相反です。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.crisis.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "amara.crisis.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "それで一週間、私を訴える練習を?"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.crisis.node.line.011a",
      "lineId": "amara.crisis.line.011a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.14shtqw",
      "speakerName": "アマラ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "傷つけない言い方を、検討していました。現在、百二件目です。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.crisis.node.line.012a",
      "lineId": "amara.crisis.line.012a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "百二件。怒ればいいのか、笑えばいいのか分からない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.crisis.node.line.012b",
      "lineId": "amara.crisis.line.012b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "この人は真面目を、いちばん不器用な使い方で使う。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.crisis.node.line.013a",
      "lineId": "amara.crisis.line.013a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.14shtqw",
      "speakerName": "アマラ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "結論は、出ています。回収される前に、私は契約ごと、あなたの前から消えるのが正しい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.crisis.node.line.014a",
      "lineId": "amara.crisis.line.014a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "アマラさんは規則集を置いて、扉へ歩き出した。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.crisis.node.line.014b",
      "lineId": "amara.crisis.line.014b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "外は、土砂降りだった。傘もささずに、雨の中へ。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.crisis.node.line.015a",
      "lineId": "amara.crisis.line.015a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "待ちなさい!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.crisis.node.line.016a",
      "lineId": "amara.crisis.line.016a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "気づいたら、走っていた。雨の中庭で追いついて、白い手袋を——つかんだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.crisis.node.line.016b",
      "lineId": "amara.crisis.line.016b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "初めて、私から触れた。耳まで、雨よりずっと熱かった。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "amara.crisis.node.direction.003",
      "command": {
        "type": "still",
        "assetId": "amara.crisis.asset.still.001"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "amara.crisis.node.direction.004",
      "command": {
        "type": "effect",
        "effectId": "pulse"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.crisis.node.line.017a",
      "lineId": "amara.crisis.line.017a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.14shtqw",
      "speakerName": "アマラ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……離してください。判決は、出ました。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.crisis.node.line.018a",
      "lineId": "amara.crisis.line.018a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "その判決、合議制違反です。本気の判断は、一人で決めない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.crisis.node.line.018b",
      "lineId": "amara.crisis.line.018b",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "あなたが記録した法ですよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.crisis.node.line.019a",
      "lineId": "amara.crisis.line.019a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "アマラさんの目が、揺れた。雨が、二人の間で音を立てていた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.crisis.node.line.020a",
      "lineId": "amara.crisis.line.020a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "判例もあります。「両者勝訴」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.crisis.node.line.020b",
      "lineId": "amara.crisis.line.020b",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "私も降りない、あなたも降りない道を探す。審理継続、です。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.crisis.node.line.021a",
      "lineId": "amara.crisis.line.021a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.14shtqw",
      "speakerName": "アマラ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……被告からの提案を、受理します。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.crisis.node.line.021b",
      "lineId": "amara.crisis.line.021b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.14shtqw",
      "speakerName": "アマラ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "前例は……あります。温泉の、卓球台に。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.crisis.node.line.022a",
      "lineId": "amara.crisis.line.022a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「本件、判決不能。審理を継続し、傍聴人の同席を求める」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.crisis.node.line.022b",
      "lineId": "amara.crisis.line.022b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "ずぶ濡れ二人分の始末書は、明日書く。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "id": "amara.crisis.node.choice.001",
      "choices": [
        {
